WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.571 --> 00:00:03.321
(relaxing music)

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:07.800
- [Narrator] At Fairmont
Hotels around the world

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.070
there is an elite fellowship
that was founded 17 years ago,

00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:15.260
right here in Canada.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.240
The fellowship of canine ambassadors.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.150
I've been a canine ambassador
at the Fairmont Chateau

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:25.240
Lake Louise for eight years now.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.443
What a life this is, let me tell ya.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:36.710
My name is Marcus, and
I'm the resident good boy

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:39.030
at the Fairmont Chateau Lake Louise.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:43.560
This here is a magical place.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:46.500
Banff National Park in Alberta, Canada.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.520
Home to almost 10,000 foot mountain peaks,

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.080
meadows covered in wildflowers,

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:56.750
and glacier lakes that are
the richest shade of blue.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:02.730
That's Bear, he's the new pup

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:04.720
over at the Fairmont Banff Springs.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:10.520
He's a bit more high-energy than me.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.250
We canine ambassadors
live with a member of the

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:18.600
Fairmont team and what we
do at our hotels is simple:

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:24.440
make people feel at home when
they're away from theirs.

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.480
As the wise old dog that I am,

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.230
I've learned a lot about the world.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.000
I've made sure that Bear knows

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.970
all the secrets to happiness here.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.440
I've let him know about giving kisses,

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.890
greeting visitors at the front door,

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.690
accompanying visitors on hikes,

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.980
and I've also let him
know about the one kind

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:51.340
of extra special visitor: these guys.

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:57.990
If you wanna know about how we feel about

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:01.570
being canine ambassadors, here's an idea:

00:02:01.570 --> 00:02:03.890
come by and see for yourself.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.607
It's a good life!

00:02:06.607 --> 00:02:09.107
(light music)

